---

### Third-Party Assets & Recovered Components

Backspin bundles and adapts third-party assets, fonts, vendor packages, and recovered shader/audio routines. These components retain their original licenses and copyrights:

- **Shaders & WebAudio:** Adapted and recovered procedural WebAudio sound engine (`src/audio.js`) and custom GLSL shaders (`src/shaders.js`).
- **Fonts:** Montserrat (OFL 1.1) and Inter (OFL 1.1).
- **Vendor Packages:** Troika three-text unicode font resolver metadata (Apache 2.0).

Please see [CREDITS.md](./CREDITS.md) for a detailed list of third-party assets, sources, and full attribution.

